      "text": "Y ESWAR / RESEARCH + CASE STUDIES\n05\nRESEARCH / CURRENT + PUBLISHED WORK\nResearch & case studies.\nQuestions, methods and design decisions.\n01 / ABOUT / DATA SCIENCE\nProfessional summary\nData scientist, researcher and AI/ML engineer.\nBackground in data analysis, machine learning and software.\nPursuing M.Tech in Data Science at GITAM University.\n02 / EDUCATION / RESEARCH\nEduSentinel\nStudies abnormal learning behaviour in LMS data.\nUses a NumPy-only deep autoencoder across eight features.\nIncludes a Flask demo; findings published on ResearchGate.",
