      "height": 806,
      "text": "KEEP TURNING THE PAGE\n06\nCASEBOOK / SELECTED STUDIES\nFrom inquiry to application.\nA collection of five studies.\n03 / SUSTAINABILITY / CASE STUDY\nSmart Energy Grid\nData-driven demand forecasting and power distribution.\nProposed LSTM pipeline for forecasting and adaptive control.\nInteractive energy-balance demonstration.\n04 / COMPUTER VISION / RESEARCH\nReal-Time Face Detection\nOpenCV face-detection pipeline with Python.\nDetected faces are stored in MongoDB.\nResearch published on ResearchGate in December 2024.\n05 / INDEPENDENT PRODUCT-DESIGN CASE STUDY\nHarkPro / Artifacts design\nProject files, latest revisions and history beside the chat.\nVersion comparison, source-message links and file downloads.\nFrontend concept with fictional data; not a live integration.",
